  "brief": [
    "Arjun, {age}, is brought to the emergency department by a friend about 20 minutes after eating at the college canteen. He’s itchy all over, short of breath and says he feels faint. You’re the first doctor to see him.",
    "Talk to him, examine him, order tests and treat. His body responds to what you do — and to what you don’t. The clock starts when you do."
  ],
  "openingLine": "Doctor… I can’t stop itching, and my throat feels weird.",
